  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short term assistance to ANRE -                   review of energy tariffs, electricity and gas - Short term assistance to ANRE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tidsberg&#xe4;nsat st&#xf6;d till ANRE -                    genomg&#xe5;ng av energitariffer, el och gas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta kortsiktiga bist&#xe5;nd har beg&#xe4;rts av National Energy Regulation Agency (ANRE) i Moldavien. Det f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bidra till en transparent, enhetlig och objektiv  granskning av motiveringarna bakom senaste prish&#xf6;jningar som lagts fram av el- och gasdistribut&#xf6;rer och leverant&#xf6;rer. Den externa  granskningen  beh&#xf6;vs f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka ANRE&apos;s position som oberoende beslutsfattare, f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rvarande i samband med reglering av prish&#xf6;jningarna p&#xe5; el och gas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This short-term assistance is requested by the National Energy Regulation Agency (ANRE) in Moldova. It will provide a transparent, uniform and objective tariff review with regard to the justifications for the recent tariff increases presented by distributors and suppliers of electricity and gas. This external assistance is needed to strengthen ANRE&#x2019;s position as an independent decision maker, currently related to the tariff regulation.</narrative>
  </description>
